college ready on the SAT?

00:04:35.670 --> 00:04:39.150
- Yes, as you mentioned, Sal,

00:04:39.150 --> 00:04:40.320
you're absolutely correct.

00:04:40.320 --> 00:04:44.210
Once we get back hopefully
to the new normal in August,

00:04:44.210 --> 00:04:47.030
we're gonna add a new
testing date in September

00:04:47.030 --> 00:04:50.590
which we have not had a
September admin before.

00:04:50.590 --> 00:04:54.690
And by providing monthly
testing beginning in August,

00:04:54.690 --> 00:04:59.460
we are confident that all
students who want an opportunity

00:04:59.460 --> 00:05:03.130
to take an SAT exam will
have the opportunity

00:05:03.130 --> 00:05:05.980
to do so throughout the fall,

00:05:05.980 --> 00:05:09.050
take it more than once if they so desire.

00:05:09.050 --> 00:05:10.150
So this once again,

00:05:10.150 --> 00:05:12.880
as counselors continue
to work with students,

00:05:12.880 --> 00:05:14.930
they will be able to advise them,

00:05:14.930 --> 00:05:16.640
what's the best administration's

00:05:16.640 --> 00:05:18.973
