they're probably in their yard

00:24:20.250 --> 00:24:23.180
or in their neighborhood
still practicing free throws.

00:24:23.180 --> 00:24:25.510
You keep practicing because
the more you practice,

00:24:25.510 --> 00:24:27.260
the better you're going to perform.

00:24:28.607 --> 00:24:30.130
- Exactly, exactly.

00:24:30.130 --> 00:24:32.130
And there's one question from Instagram,

00:24:32.130 --> 00:24:33.090
